{
  "The existing settings of ddraw.ini and sfall-mods.ini were saved successfully.": "ddraw.ini 與 sfall-mods.ini 的現有設定已成功儲存。",
  "Save the settings and close.": "儲存設定並關閉。",
  "Assign another key.": "指定其他按鍵。",
  "Width": "寬度",
  "Height": "高度",
  "Also set the chosen resolution in the Hi-Res patch settings.": "同時在 Hi-Res 修補程式的設定中套用所選的解析度。",
  "Resolutions available on this system.": "此系統可用的解析度。",
  "Lets you directly control every party member in combat.": "讓你在戰鬥中直接控制每一位隊友。",
  "Alternative behaviors for hand-to-hand attacks and the \"Fast Shot\" trait.": "徒手攻擊與「Fast Shot」特性的替代行為。",
  "Damage formula (used to calculate damage in various mods).": "傷害公式(供各種模組計算傷害時使用)。",
  "Number of AP. 0 to disable.": "行動點數 (AP)。0 表示停用。",
  "Enables an alternative spray formula for the flight of bullets in burst fire.\nThe formula is based on the weapon skill level of your character (or of a party member):\nthe higher the skill (above 100%), the more bullets land in the central group,\nand with a low skill you get a PENALTY and more bullets are spread\nover the adjacent lines of the spray.": "啟用連發射擊時子彈飛行的替代散布公式。\n此公式取決於你的角色(或隊友)的武器技能等級:\n技能越高(超過 100%),落在中央群組的子彈越多;\n技能偏低時會受到懲罰,更多子彈會散布\n到鄰近的射線上。",
  "0 - Prevents a burst with a probability of INT*10% of the attacking NPC.\n1 - Always prevents the attack when a friendly NPC is on the direct line of fire.\n2 - Increases the number of checks before an attack; the number of checks is based\n     on the INT*16 of the attacking NPC (by default the game makes only one check).\n3 - Enables modes 1 and 2: mode 1 plus extra checks for the adjacent lines of fire.\n-1 - Completely disables this feature of sfall.": "0 - 以攻擊方 NPC 的 INT*10% 機率阻止連發。\n1 - 只要友方 NPC 位於直接射線上,一律阻止攻擊。\n2 - 增加攻擊前的檢查次數;檢查次數取決於\n     攻擊方 NPC 的 INT*16(遊戲預設只檢查一次)。\n3 - 同時啟用模式 1 與 2:模式 1 再加上對鄰近射線的額外檢查。\n-1 - 完全停用 sfall 的這項功能。",
  "Enables improved AI behavior algorithms in combat.": "啟用戰鬥中改良的 AI 行為演算法。",
  "Highlights the items on the map while the key is held (Shift by default).": "按住按鍵時在地圖上醒目標示物品(預設為 Shift)。",
  "A value (1..999) sets the number of pages used for quick saves.\n0 to disable.\n\nIf Start Save Page is set to -1, this sets the number of slots per page for quick saves.\n": "數值 (1..999) 設定快速存檔所用的頁數。\n0 表示停用。\n\n若 Start Save Page 設為 -1,則此值為快速存檔每頁的欄位數。\n",
  "Allowed range: 0...999": "允許範圍:0...999",
  "Number of pages reserved for automatic saves.": "為自動存檔保留的頁數。",
  "Timeout in game seconds before the next automatic save.": "距離下次自動存檔的遊戲內秒數。",
  "Enables the built-in hero appearance mod.": "啟用內建的主角外觀模組。",
  "Reports changes of the player's karma in the information window of the game interface.": "在遊戲介面的資訊視窗中顯示玩家業力的變化。",
  "Automatically opens unlocked doors when walking through them.": "走過未上鎖的門時自動開門。",
  "Automatically closes the doors that NPCs open when they pass through them.": "自動關上 NPC 經過時打開的門。",
  "Time limit of the game in years.": "遊戲的時間限制(以年計)。",
  "Minimum 10%, maximum 1000%.": "最小 10%,最大 1000%。",
  "Enter a description for {0}": "請輸入 {0} 的說明",
  "Path to the file or folder of Master.dat": "Master.dat 的檔案或資料夾路徑",
  "Path to the Master patch folder.": "Master 修補資料夾的路徑。",
  "Path to the file or folder of Critter.dat": "Critter.dat 的檔案或資料夾路徑",
  "Path to the Critter patch folder.": "Critter 修補資料夾的路徑。",
  "Path to the music folder.": "音樂資料夾的路徑。",
  "Language of the game.": "遊戲語言。",
  "Choose the game configuration file.": "選擇遊戲設定檔。",
  "The graphics mode set here overrides the mode set in f2_res.ini.\nNote:\nThe DX7 modes are used by the Hi-Res patch built into sFall since v5.0.\nFor the built-in Hi-Res patch, mode 0 (Off) works like DX7 Fullscreen.": "此處設定的圖形模式會覆寫 f2_res.ini 中的模式。\n注意:\n自 v5.0 起,內建於 sFall 的 Hi-Res 修補程式使用 DX7 模式。\n對於內建的 Hi-Res 修補程式,模式 0 (Off) 的作用等同 DX7 全螢幕。",
  "Sets the scaling quality of the game movies.": "設定遊戲影片的縮放品質。",
  "Limits a high FPS in the game (DX9 mode).\nIf your graphics card gets very hot while playing, enable this option to reduce its load.\nOtherwise it is not recommended, as it may affect the rendering of the game picture.": "限制遊戲中過高的 FPS (DX9 模式)。\n若遊玩時顯示卡溫度過高,可啟用此選項以降低負載。\n否則不建議使用,因為可能影響遊戲畫面的繪製。",
  "Uses a hardware shader in the DX9 graphics mode.": "在 DX9 圖形模式中使用硬體著色器。",
  "Note: If the game runs with a bad FPS (slowdown) in DX9 Fullscreen mode, switch to DirectX 9 in the \"Hi-Res Config\" tab, after setting the \"Graphics Mode\" option here to Off. If that does not help, disable VSync for your graphics card.": "注意:若遊戲在 DX9 全螢幕模式下 FPS 不佳(變慢),請先將此處的「Graphics Mode」選項設為 Off,再到「Hi-Res Config」分頁切換為 DirectX 9。若仍無改善,請停用顯示卡的垂直同步 (VSync)。",
  "Full Screen - the game runs full screen.\nWindowed - the game runs in a window.": "Full Screen - 遊戲以全螢幕執行。\nWindowed - 遊戲以視窗執行。",
  "Extends the lower edge of the map view down to the bottom of the game window;\nthe interface bar is then drawn over the map, without side panels at the bottom.\nThe bar can be hidden by holding the key assigned to the HideInterfaceKey option (file sfall-mods.ini).\n": "將地圖畫面的下緣延伸到遊戲視窗底部;\n介面列會繪製在地圖之上,底部不再有側面板。\n按住指派給 HideInterfaceKey 選項的按鍵(檔案 sfall-mods.ini)即可隱藏介面列。\n",
  "Picture of the side panels.": "側面板的圖片。",
  "Type of the alternative ammo meter.\n\nDisabled - the standard one.\nDivides colour - splits the meter into several colored sections.": "替代彈藥計量表的類型。\n\nDisabled - 標準計量表。\nDivides colour - 將計量表分成數個彩色區段。",
  "The map and the player's interface bar are hidden during a dialogue with an NPC.": "與 NPC 對話時隱藏地圖與玩家的介面列。",
  "Increases the display time of the start picture, in seconds.": "延長起始畫面的顯示時間(秒)。",
  "Ignores the map scrolling limits around the player.": "忽略玩家周圍的地圖捲動限制。",
  "Enables the fog of war mod.": "啟用戰爭迷霧模組。",
  "Reduces the processor load by letting the system idle.": "讓系統進入閒置狀態以降低處理器負載。",
  "Uses the dialogue window interface picture made by Continuum.": "使用 Continuum 製作的對話視窗介面圖片。",
  "Path to the resource file of the Hi-Res patch.": "Hi-Res 修補程式資源檔的路徑。",
  "Path to the patch folder.": "修補資料夾的路徑。",
  "The selected game executable could not be patched.": "無法修補所選的遊戲執行檔。",
  "Additionally shows the electrical resistance of the armor in the player's inventory.": "另外在玩家物品欄中顯示護甲的電擊抗性。",
  "Shows numbers next to the player's replies in dialogues.": "在對話中於玩家的回答旁顯示編號。",
  "Expands the inventory interface.": "擴充物品欄介面。",
  "Uses the expanded world map interface.": "使用擴充的世界地圖介面。",
  "Uses an interface of 1280x720 pixels for the world map.": "世界地圖使用 1280x720 像素的介面。",
  "Shows the terrain type of the world map when the cursor is over the player's marker.": "游標位於玩家標記上時,顯示世界地圖的地形類型。",
  "Makes the black unexplored areas of the world map translucent.": "讓世界地圖上黑色的未探索區域呈半透明。",
  "Speeds up the animation of the alarm clock time counter in the Pip-Boy.": "加快 Pip-Boy 中鬧鐘時間計數器的動畫。",
  "Speeds up the animation of the HP/AC counter.": "加快 HP/AC 計數器的動畫。",
  "Controls the animation speed of the combat panel.\nLower is faster.": "控制戰鬥面板的動畫速度。\n數值越小越快。",
  "Controls the animation speed of the dialogue panel.\nLower is faster.": "控制對話面板的動畫速度。\n數值越小越快。",
  "Type of the buttons.": "按鈕類型。",
  "Shows buttons in the PipBoy to scroll the list of quests.\n\nSince sfall 5.0.1 pages for quests are the default,\nthis option changes the default display to buttons.": "在 PipBoy 中顯示用來捲動任務清單的按鈕。\n\n自 sfall 5.0.1 起,任務預設以分頁顯示,\n此選項會將預設顯示方式改為按鈕。",
  "Position of the buttons on the X axis": "按鈕在 X 軸上的位置",
  "Position of the buttons on the Y axis": "按鈕在 Y 軸上的位置",
  "A hot key to quickly pick up the nearest item on the map.": "用來快速撿起地圖上最近物品的快捷鍵。",
  "Allows moving a whole stack of items from containers to the player's inventory\nwithout holding the Ctrl key (or the key assigned to the ItemFastMoveKey option).\nThe ItemFastMoveKey option must be enabled; holding the assigned key (Ctrl by default)\nshows the item move window.": "無須按住 Ctrl 鍵(或指派給 ItemFastMoveKey 選項的按鍵),\n即可將整疊物品從容器移到玩家的物品欄。\n必須啟用 ItemFastMoveKey 選項;按住指派的按鍵(預設為 Ctrl)\n會顯示物品移動視窗。",
  "Allows selling Geiger counters or Stealth Boys that were used before.": "允許販賣曾經使用過的蓋革計數器或隱形裝置 (Stealth Boy)。",
  "Automatically reloads the player's weapon after the combat.": "戰鬥結束後自動為玩家的武器重新裝填。",
  "Automatically closes a container after it was searched.": "搜尋完容器後自動關閉。",
  "Save the settings and start the game ({0}).": "儲存設定並啟動遊戲 ({0})。",
  "ddraw.ini was not found.": "找不到 ddraw.ini。",
  "Open error": "開啟錯誤",
  "Enables the built-in alternative formula for the \"Heave Ho\" perk.\nIt removes the strength limit of the perk and applies the set modifier (+3)\nto the maximum throwing range for each level of the perk.": "啟用內建的「Heave Ho」特技替代公式。\n它會移除該特技的力量限制,並對該特技的每一級\n套用設定的修正值 (+3) 到最大投擲距離。",
  "Lets NPCs see through objects that can be shot through (Shoot Thru flag).": "讓 NPC 能看穿可射穿的物件(Shoot Thru 旗標)。",
  "Shows the messages of an active Geiger counter when radiation is received.": "受到輻射時顯示啟動中蓋革計數器的訊息。",
  "Changes the behavior of the motion sensor item.\n\n0 - Fallout 2 behavior (default).\n1 - Can be used even when the motion sensor is in the inventory.\n2 - The motion sensor does not need charges.\n3 - Both modes 1 and 2.": "改變動作感應器物品的行為。\n\n0 - 《異塵餘生 2》原本的行為(預設)。\n1 - 動作感應器在物品欄中時也能使用。\n2 - 動作感應器不需要電量。\n3 - 同時啟用模式 1 與 2。",
  "Allowed range: 0..3\nA value of 0 disables this behavior.": "允許範圍:0..3\n數值 0 表示停用此行為。",
  "Allowed range: 0..13.\n0 stands for 12 hours.": "允許範圍:0..13。\n0 代表 12 小時。",
  "Doubles the speed of the screen fade effects.": "將畫面淡入淡出效果的速度加倍。",
  "Lets explosions and projectiles emit light on the map.": "讓爆炸與投射物在地圖上發光。",
  "Sets the number of sound effects that can play at the same time in the game.\nMaximum 32, minimum 4. 0 is the default value.": "設定遊戲中可同時播放的音效數量。\n最大 32,最小 4。預設值為 0。",
  "Number of animated objects at the same time on one map.\nMinimum 32, maximum 127.": "單一地圖上同時存在的動畫物件數量。\n最小 32,最大 127。",
  "Takes the orientation flags of the object prototype into account when lighting a map object.\nEnable it if the orientation flags in the Scenery prototypes are set correctly:\nthe light is then projected onto the sprite of the object depending on its direction.": "為地圖物件打光時會考慮物件原型的朝向旗標。\n若 Scenery 原型中的朝向旗標設定正確,請啟用此選項:\n光線會依物件的方向投射到物件的圖像上。",
  "Disables the automatic loading of the mods that are not in the list.": "停用清單中沒有的模組的自動載入。",
  "- The lower mods of the list have priority over the upper ones: the files of a lower mod\noverride the files of the upper mods.\n\n- A gray check box means that the file(s) or the folder of the mod are missing.": "- 清單中位置較下方的模組優先於上方的模組:下方模組的檔案\n會覆蓋上方模組的檔案。\n\n- 灰色的核取方塊表示該模組的檔案或資料夾不存在。",
  "The file or the folder of this mod is missing.": "此模組的檔案或資料夾不存在。",
  "Now choose the required resolution.": "現在請選擇所需的解析度。",
  "The settings were transferred successfully!": "設定已成功轉移!",
  "Enable it to prevent a CPU usage of 100%.": "啟用以避免 CPU 使用率達到 100%。",
  "Does not use several processor cores, even when they are available.": "即使有多個處理器核心可用,也不使用。",
  "Overrides the art_cache_size parameter of fallout2.cfg with the value 256.": "以 256 覆寫 fallout2.cfg 的 art_cache_size 參數。",
  "Skips the intro movies and the splash screens when the game starts.": "遊戲啟動時略過開場影片與啟動畫面。",
  "Mode of the debug log output.": "除錯記錄的輸出模式。",
  "Enables the debug mode.": "啟用除錯模式。",
  "Choose a file.": "選擇檔案。",
  "Uses the sfall.dll library instead of the system ddraw.dll.\nNote: ddraw.dll must be renamed to sfall.dll.\n\nAn alternative way of loading the sfall library for operating systems that are not compatible with Windows.\nIt needs no extra steps to override the loading of ddraw.dll on such systems.": "使用 sfall.dll 程式庫取代系統的 ddraw.dll。\n注意:必須將 ddraw.dll 重新命名為 sfall.dll。\n\n這是在與 Windows 不相容的作業系統上載入 sfall 程式庫的替代方式。\n在這類系統上,不需要額外步驟即可覆寫 ddraw.dll 的載入。",
  "Gets the CRC value of a file.": "取得檔案的 CRC 值。",
  "Enables the mouse wheel to scroll the item lists in the inventory.": "啟用以滑鼠滾輪捲動物品欄中的物品清單。",
  "Reverses the mouse buttons (from left to right).": "對調滑鼠按鍵(由左至右)。",
  "Key that switches the keyboard layout (English/Russian) when typing.": "輸入時用來切換鍵盤配置(英文/俄文)的按鍵。",
  "Encoding of the Cyrillic characters, depending on the font of the game.": "西里爾字元的編碼,取決於遊戲的字型。",
  "The selected game executable could not be patched. Select Fallout2.exe in the settings and try again.": "無法修補所選的遊戲執行檔。請在設定中選擇 Fallout2.exe 後再試一次。",
